#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Connect to the Air Force EITaaS VDI (Azure Virtual Desktop, US Government) from Omarchy.

The session runs in the distribution's sdl-freerdp3 (native Wayland) with the CAC redirected
into Windows over PC/SC. FreeRDP's Entra ID sign-in is handed to a dedicated Chrome profile,
which already does CAC client-certificate auth through the OpenSC module in ~/.pki/nssdb;
the OAuth redirect is captured over Chrome's private DevTools pipe and fed back to FreeRDP.

  eitaas-vdi [connect]      connect with the imported profile
  eitaas-vdi setup [FILE]   import a .rdpw profile (without FILE: download it via the web client)
  eitaas-vdi doctor         check the smart-card stack, reader, card, and profile
                            (--dialog shows the result in a popup)
  eitaas-vdi signout        forget the sign-in browser's cookies
"""

